# Gatekeeper of Malakir: "Kicker {B}" (CR 702.33a) and "When this creature enters, if it was kicked, target player sacrifices a creature of their choice." (CR 603.4, 701.21a)
# Bot2 controls a Memnite and an Ornithopter. Bot1 sacrifices its Black Lotus for {B}{B}{B}, adds {R} with Mox Ruby, and casts Gatekeeper kicked: {B}{B}{B} is paid and the {R} is
# left (a kicker of {1} would have taken it), then targets Bot2. Bot2 chooses which creature to sacrifice (it picks the Ornithopter, the second one offered), and the Gatekeeper itself stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Gatekeeper of Malakir
Mox Ruby
Island x4
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island x5
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Gatekeeper of Malakir.Cast(Kicked: 1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Mana = {R}
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Choose(Ornithopter)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Gatekeeper of Malakir
Bot2.Battlefield = Memnite
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
